uote vile  posts on social media claiming that her  book isn't about her big sister a  sentiment the mom of two also shared  with e.t this book isn't about me trying  to clear up anything it's about me using  my voice and showing my daughters that  your voice is important that's what this  book is about in part two of jamie  lynn's call her daddy tell-all the now  30-year-old shared a text that she  allegedly sent both britney and sam in  2020. in an effort to prove that she  tried to help her sister get out of her  conservatorship november 11th 2020 10 45  pm and then i resent it to her boyfriend  the next morning but according to e.t  source  sam isn't happy about all that  quote he feels very protective over  britney and also himself et source says  sam has been britney's rock adding that  he's used to being her support system  behind the scenes i'm really blessed  quote brittany and sam are both trying  to focus on the good in their lives and  stay positive but jamie lynn's interview  really upset both of them i don't have  all the answers i'm just trying to do  the best i can every day with everything  that is you know going on just like many  other families in this world and despite  all the drama a source previously told  et quote jamie lynn has genuinely always  wanted the best for brittany and she  loves britney with all of her heart  despite their complicated relationship  [Music]

